            "The Tremere can take three more points of Flaws, and a similar number of Virtues. At the moment, he is a social and political creature, but the score in one of those Abilities could be moved into a Martial Ability to make him more of a fighter. Elemental Magic makes it difficult to move Art scores around. Initially, he was assigned scores of Aq 3, Au 6, Ig 6, and Te 6."
            "Aquam received an additional 33 experience points (from Auram, Ignem and Terram), for a final total of 39 and a score of 8 (3), and each of the other Arts received an additional 25 experience points, for a final total of 46 and a score of 9 (1)."
        }
    }
