            ^"Category" STRING "Supernatural" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "+3 Size, +1 Warping."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The interior of the lab is in a regio, and there is an another regio level, which the owner can navigate easily. If there are further regio levels, this Virtue may be taken more than once."
    }
