            ^"Category" STRING "Supernatural" FIXED
            ^"Modifiers" STRING "–2 Safety; +2 Pe."
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab contains some kind of magical void, such as a bottomless well. This may be made into a Void Feature (purchased as usual)."
