        DESCRIPTION "A low wave is formed to propel a small boat slowly through the water. When casting this spell, you commonly make a pushing gesture. This spell, and other similar ones, pick out a particular current in the body of water and make it behave as desired, and thus have Individual Targets.

In Silva of Merinita's version of this spell, the wave occasionally drifts or bobs about, as if it is happy and playful."
    }
    #tjxaXlZQVtPC9DCWByEDlcCN ^"Bridge of Frost" DEF {
