            ^"Range" STRING "Voice"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Diameter"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 2
            MODIFIERS {
                +2 "Voice"
                +1 "Diam"
                +1 "intelligible speech"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Creates an illusory face on a wall or other flat object. The visage can speak during the spell's duration. Individual wizards' sigils can produce very interesting differences in how the voice sounds, how the face looks, and so on."
    }
    #tMawjLkxB1VE83VmQnmChMw5 ^"Phantasmal Animal" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Creo" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"Level" INTEGER 20 FIXED
            ^"Range" STRING "Voice"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Diameter"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 3
            MODIFIERS {
                +2 "Voice"
                +1 "Diam"
                +2 "move under your command"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Creates an image of any animal or beast up to the size of a pony (Size +1). Under your direct mental command, it moves about (within range) and makes appropriate noises. You need to be able to concentrate, and be within range, whenever you wish to direct the illusion to move in some manner. If you move out of range or stop concentrating, the illusion just freezes in place. The image does smell like an animal, but it has absolutely no effect on the sense of touch. Of course, a magus may not use this spell to create the image of an animal he or she does not know exists."
    }
    #tT8P234GfDZFCipJeVoHcEXA ^"Phantasmal Fire" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Creo" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"Level" INTEGER 20 FIXED
            ^"Range" STRING "Voice"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Sun"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Requisite" STRING "Ignem"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 3
            MODIFIERS {
                +2 "Voice"
                +2 "Sun"
                +1 "for light from Ignem requisite"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Makes an image of a fire (up to the size of a large campfire) that dances, illuminates, crackles, and (apparently) warms. It does not spread, burn, or protect against cold. Makes a great joke at gatherings of House Flambeau, although creating a real fire is even more popular."
        REFERENCES {
            "House Flambeau" -> #tFDuJ170qtqPvn7bszcz33BT ^"House Flambeau"
        }
    }
    #to5bSBSGIrkH7KB2ypu8zbNM ^"Phantasm of the Human Form" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Creo" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25 FIXED
            ^"Range" STRING "Voice"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Sun"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 2
            MODIFIERS {
                +2 "Voice"
                +2 "Sun"
                +2 "move at your command"
                +1 "intricacy"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Makes an image of a clothed and equipped person that can make noise. Under your direct, unspoken command, the person can move about, speak, and behave as a human does."
    }
    #tWhfL4uvnqOZLDcxfV51ym33 ^"Haunt of the Living Ghost" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Creo" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35 FIXED
            ^"Range" STRING "Arcane Connection"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Concentration"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Requisite" STRING "Intellego"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 2
            MODIFIERS {
                +4 "Arc"
                +1 "Conc"
                +2 "move at your command"
                +1 "intricacy"
                +1 "Intellego requisite"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "With this spell, you can instantly project your own image and voice to any designated spot that you have an Arcane Connection to (though troupes may wish to limit this range to some absolute distance like 300 miles). You can see and hear through the image. The image must appear in some medium, such as a fire, mirror, or pool. Some magi use this spell to attend inter-covenant councils without traveling the intervening distance. Because other magi can see you, this spell is not held to constitute scrying by magic. Using it through another covenant's Aegis counts as showing off, however."
    }
    #tMfLkEu7mBIO9K1bRDsHwm8H ^"The Shadow of Human Life" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Creo" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"Level" INTEGER 40 FIXED
            ^"Range" STRING "Touch"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Sun"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Requisite" STRING "Mentem"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 2
            MODIFIERS {
                +1 "Touch"
                +2 "Sun"
                +1 "intricacy"
                +6 "Mentem requisite"
            }
            NOTES ["for a very elaborate effect"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The human image created (as in Phantasm of the Human Form) has limited freedom and simulated intellect. It functions as an independent human, albeit a stupid one, capable of interpreting general orders in new situations."
        REFERENCES {
            "Phantasm of the Human Form" -> #to5bSBSGIrkH7KB2ypu8zbNM ^"Phantasm of the Human Form"
        }
    }
    #tJypRVXbDYEmNvlxPYftVQNP ^"Discern the Images of Truth and Falsehood" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Intellego" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"General Level" BOOLEAN true
            ^"Range" STRING "Personal"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Concentration"
            ^"Target" STRING "Vision"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            MODIFIERS {
                +1 "Conc"
            }
            NOTES ["Base effect, +1 Conc"]
        }
        DESCRIPTION "You can tell whether an image has been created or altered through a spell, seeing both the original and false images in the case of alterations. This spell must be at least 1 magnitude higher than an illusion in order to discern it. If you botch the spell, you mistake illusions for the real thing and reality for illusion. Your discernment is not limited to visual illusions, although you can only tell that a sound is illusory if you are looking at the apparent source."
    }
    #tWax724AX1WVlkf3pPZ0RaME ^"Prying Eyes" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tL4MotIBVF5lx9HoVrT1yDlM ^"Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Creature" STRING "Cat (Greater or Lesser Power)" FIXED
            ^"Page" INTEGER 71
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "1 point, Imaginem R: Touch, D: Conc, T: Room This effect is used to look inside buildings and rooms while patrolling a house or town. Note that a cat touching the roof of a room can see inside it.. (5 spell levels: Base 1, +1 Touch, +1 Conc +2 Room)"
    }
    #tDLXSCPHtpjEW5oN837MIJLi ^"Discern Own Illusions" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
