        DESCRIPTION "Allows the non-principal faerie of an area to coat an object with illusion, making it seem to be some other thing of approximately the same size and shape.

Costs 20 spell levels, as spell of the same name ArM5 page 146. (Base 5 +1 Touch +2 Sun)"
