            BASE 4
            MODIFIERS {
                +2 "Voice"
                +2 "Sun"
                +1 "Part"
                +1 "changing image"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Captures a person's voice and places it in a bag. The person may not speak unless the bag is open, in which case the voice comes from the bag, not the victim's mouth. If the victim screams while the bag is shut, the bag vibrates visibly."
    }
    #t70uxq1GLOxTvAERhTGhBpus ^"Confusion of the Insane Vibrations" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Rego" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"Level" INTEGER 30 FIXED
            ^"Range" STRING "Touch"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Concentration"
            ^"Target" STRING "Vision"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 3
            MODIFIERS {
                +1 "Touch"
                +1 "Conc"
                +4 "Vision"
                +1 "additional senses"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The target of the spell sees everything vibrate back and forth at varying high speeds. In addition, sounds are displaced and seem to come from the wrong areas. Anyone trying to fight in these circumstances suffers –3 on Attack and Defense scores, and must roll two extra botch dice. The target is likely to become desperate and terribly confused. Navigation is exceedingly difficult. The visual effects of this spell are negated if the target is in complete darkness or if they close their eyes."
    }
    #tXVf2cQwxwZXzK0vNRPftDzZ ^"Image from the Wizard Torn" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tM30boZOkiiaD5LRZZQQ1ymk ^"Formulaic Spell"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Technique" STRING "Rego" FIXED
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem" FIXED
            ^"Level" INTEGER 35 FIXED
            ^"Range" STRING "Personal"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Concentration"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Requisite" STRING "Intellego"
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        LEVEL_CALCULATION {
            BASE 15
            MODIFIERS {
                +1 "Conc"
                +1 "additional sense"
                +1 "moving image"
                +1 "Intellego requisite"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Your image separates from your body. It can speak whatever you say and do so in your voice, and you can see through its eyes. You must make an Int + Concentration stress roll for each solid object the image passes through and for each mile it travels. If you wish the image to be able to leave your sight, you must use an Arcane Connection to yourself (for example, a fingernail or a lock of hair) when you cast the spell. That connection becomes an integral part of the image, and when the spell ends, it falls to the ground wherever the image was located. As your image is away from your body, you are invisible and silent at your actual location. The image is your image, so while you may move it in space you may not have it sit down if you are standing. Further, it appears as if illuminated by whatever light is falling on you, no matter what the level of illumination is at the image."
    }
    #tNfHSLmhUAJgw23OiyFuTMmc ^"Illusion of the Misplaced Castle" DEF {
