            BASE 3
            MODIFIERS {
                +2 "Voice"
                +2 "Sun"
                +2 "Group"
                +2 "fancy effect"
            }
        }
        DESCRIPTION "You cause twenty pointed pillars of white marble to spring up from the ground to a height of 12 feet, forming a circle 3 paces in diameter. At their tops, the pillars are thin and as sharp as spears. At the base, where they touch, they are 18 inches thick. When the pillars spring up, they can be used to cage people, to form a wall, or simply to skewer enemies. Climbing to the top of the pillars requires three Dexterity + Athletics stress rolls against an Ease Factor of 12, and the tops break away when the target reaches them, causing the victim to fall. Skewering a target does +25 damage, possibly more on following rounds if the victim struggles or is exceptionally heavy. When the spell ends, the pillars crumble to dust."
        REFERENCES {
            "Ease Factor" -> #tGQufzy8y8Qc3foo2n9p7nMU ^"Ease Factor"
        }
    }
