            ^"Group" STRING "Structure" FIXED
            ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab has enough spare room that its outfittings can be spread out a little. If building a lab from scratch and if space permits, you may choose to start with this Virtue, without needing an extra season of work. +2 Safety, +1 Aesthetics."
