            ^"Group" STRING "Structure" FIXED
            ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is located at least four floors up, or on the top floor of a tower, which affords a commanding view of the surroundings. +1 Aesthetics; +1 Au."
    }
    #tsku29yRshhOVZF0lZI55tjp ^"Grand Entrance" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tYwoQHJhsRianV3Iui1tcZOt ^"Laboratory Virtue"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Group" STRING "Structure" FIXED
            ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "An elaborate and sizable entranceway, such as a great door or arch, an opulent lobby, or perhaps a reception room leads to the lab. This takes up more of the sanctum space, but not usually of the laboratory chamber itself. It often takes a season or more for craftsmen to build or outfit. The sanctum marker is likely displayed prominently. The lab at least looks good from the outside, so casual observers are likely to be impressed. +2 Aesthetics."
    }
    #tOrXZswBf6BFZhcFkrGGsWLV ^"Idyllic Surroundings" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tYwoQHJhsRianV3Iui1tcZOt ^"Laboratory Virtue"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Group" STRING "Structure" FIXED
            ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is located some way by itself, in a charming and peaceful location, such as in a beautiful vale or garden. +2 Health, +1 Aesthetics; 1 point on a Specialization in Cr, An, Aq, He, or Te, depending upon terrain type."
    }
    #tQhNDoPClL4AGbIko9cZbfsu ^"Mobile" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tYwoQHJhsRianV3Iui1tcZOt ^"Laboratory Virtue"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Group" STRING "Structure" FIXED
            ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The entire lab can be readily moved. For example, it might be located on a ship or (if it is very small) a cart. This Virtue is usually taken with the Unstable Flaw. +1 Experimentation."
    }
    #tYNlwJVIxpsir1VCWGAaqg1O ^"Mountaintop" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tYwoQHJhsRianV3Iui1tcZOt ^"Laboratory Virtue"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Magnitude" STRING "Free" FIXED
            ^"Group" STRING "Structure" FIXED
            ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
            ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The lab is located at the peak of a mountain. This is a dramatic and remote setting with a spectacular view, prone to strong winds and snows. –1 Safety, +1 Upkeep, +2 Aesthetics; +2 Au."
    }
    #tbVYw07TQXXX7z5ouMbqWYRf ^"Superior Construction" DEF {
