and Unholiness 4 (ghosts), Theology 2 (purgatory) **Arts: Tu** 1,** Su **(n/a)**, Vu **(n/a)**, Fa **(n/a)**, Ma **7**, Sa** 7 **Equipment:** Simple robes. **Encumbrance:** 0 (0) **Spells Known:** *Magical Fortitude Charm against Magical Claws (+10 Soak) *(TuMa 10/+5) *Charm of Alacritous Fortune against Claws (+4 Defense) *(TuMa 10/+5) *Charm against Hex (+9 Ease Factor) *(TuMa

