            ^"Range" STRING "Touch"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Sun"
            ^"Target" STRING "Ind"
            ^"Printed Stat Line" STRING "MuIm 10 R: Touch, D: Sun, T: Ind"
            ^"Source" STRING "Houses of Hermes: Societates"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "This spell is a variant of *Aura of Ennobled Presence*, except that it causes the target to appear more guileless, gullible, and naïve. The character gets a +3 to rolls to deflect suspicion or convince others of his innocence. In a debate, the target receives a +3 to defenses based on Guile. To those affected by the caster’s Gift, his apparent innocence and unblemished honor appears sanctimonious and self-righteous.

(Base 3, +1 Touch, +2 Sun)"
    }
