        DESCRIPTION "5 points, Init equal to (Qik – 10), Vim R: Touch, D: Mom, T: Ind, Ritual Imposes the named Flaw upon a victim. Each creature may have more than one power of this type, each bestowing a different Flaw. The creature can decide to bestow the Flaw permanently or temporarily. If permanent, the power is a ritual-like power and costs points from the creature’s Might score as well as Might pool (see Ritual Power, below). If temporary, the Might points spent on this power are only recovered when its effects are withdrawn. No Hermetic equivalent: Ritual Power"
