            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "This power causes the faerie to seem more attractive and pleasant than it really is, granting a +3 bonus on all rolls that involve impressing or convincing others.

Costs 10 spell levels (Base 3 +1 Touch +2 Sun)"
    }
    #tQbWFzbIpiN5KdjhTLWrtJCK ^"Cause Fatigue" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "2 points, Init –2, usually Corpus but varies"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 2
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init –2"
            ^"Form" STRING "usually Corpus but varies"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "This faerie can cause a human to lose a fatigue level. The mechanism that harms the human varies by faerie. Some harvest faeries cause heatstroke, for example.

Costs 20 spell levels (Base 10 +2 Voice)"
    }
    #tWGTBB3wBCGUvErgEwWRaOuF ^"Cause Drowsiness" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "1 point, Init –1, Corpus or Animal"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 1
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init –1"
            ^"Form" STRING "Corpus or Animal"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Allows the faerie to cause a human it touches to fall asleep. Versions that are slightly more powerful allow the faerie to affect people at Voice range, or keep them asleep until a certain time.

Costs 5 spell levels for Touch range (Base 4 +1 Touch), Costs 10 spell levels for Voice range (Base 4 +2 Voice). Costs 1 Might, Init –1.

Add 20 spell levels for Until duration. Cost rises by 2 Might points and Initiative has further –2 penalty."
    }
    #tgHUz7QlzQQPIlWkIoLHGWMq ^"Cause Sickness" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "3 points, Init –3, Corpus"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 3
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init –3"
            ^"Form" STRING "Corpus"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The faerie can cause a specific, serious illness with its touch, or poison objects it touches so that they harm humans who consume them. See ArM5 page 133 for guidelines.

Costs 25 spell levels (Base 20 +1 Touch)"
    }
    #tVQKv25L4mpoCxahb6JtWNwz ^"Craft Magical Trinket" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "10/15 points, Init 0, as per target"
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init 0"
            ^"Form" STRING "as per target"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The faerie may create an object, from glamour, that allows the character with the trinket to use a particular Virtue once. The Virtue that the faerie’s trinkets permit is selected at character creation. The faerie does not automatically regain the Might spent to produce a trinket, but may refresh itself if it has Virtues that allow it to regain Might by consuming sacrifices or humans.

The trinket ceases to function when a condition placed at the time of creation is met, or when it spends an entire day when no human with a passionate intention to use it for a specific purpose beholds it. This makes stockpiling trinkets impossible except in dire situations. In exceptional circumstances, large numbers of trinkets are possible: for example, in a covenant that knows it will soon have to withstand a Mongol siege, it might be possible for the faerie to give a trinket to each of the covenfolk.

A trinket costs 10 Might points if it invokes a Minor Virtue, and 15 points if it invokes a Major Virtue.

Costs 50 spell levels (Special)"
    }
    #t885Vlj2jC9rqq8xEP0AI5tP ^"Damaging Effect" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "2 points, Init –2, By weapon"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 2
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init –2"
            ^"Form" STRING "By weapon"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Causes all of the faerie’s weapons, which are part of its glamour, to take on a more deadly aspect for two minutes. The danger of the aspect varies according to the motif usual for the faerie, but always increases the weapon’s Damage by +5. Faeries that produce mounts from their glamour can improve the Damage of those mounts with this power, since they are effectively weapons of the faerie.

Costs 15 spell levels (Base 5 +1 Part +1 Diameter. This Base is lower than might appear usual in Hermetic magic, because faeries are creatures of stories, and conflict is such a useful tool in roleplaying games.)"
        REFERENCES {
            "Hermetic magic" -> #tARMDefConceptHermeticMagic ^"Hermetic Magic"
        }
    }
    #tqAEFlrIP8V7B7hJEiYf9cNw ^"Eidolon" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tL4MotIBVF5lx9HoVrT1yDlM ^"Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Creature" STRING "Spirit" FIXED
            ^"Page" INTEGER 102
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "0 points, Init equal to Qik, Imaginem R: Touch, D: Conc, T: Ind Creates an illusionary form that is visible and audible to material beings. The spirit can create a single form with each version of this power it possesses. The image can move and speak as directed by the spirit, and lasts until the spirit has no further use for it. CrIm 15 (base 2, +1 Touch, +1 Conc, +2 move at command, +1 intricacy): Greater Power (15 levels, +2 Init, –2 Might cost; 15 levels surplus)"
        REFERENCES {
            "Greater Power" -> #tI9yiBqA2pLll1mfoJpQrwzX ^"Greater Power"
        }
    }
    #tEaK0HfH5TSsTAdkNyxgWo9j ^"Enthralling Sound" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "3 points, Init –3, Mentem"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 3
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init –3"
            ^"Form" STRING "Mentem"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Allows a faerie to create a particular emotion in any group of people that can hear it. Fear, loyalty, and infatuation are popular choices. This power also increases the intensity of an emotion that already exists. A stress roll with an appropriate Personality trait against an Ease Factor of 9 allows a victim to overcome this power’s effect.

Costs 30 spell levels (CrMe Base 4 +2 Voice +2 Sun +2 Group)"
    }
    #tZR5do9Ta6zkNdxr30DOaATK ^"Enthrallment" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "4 points, Init –4, Mentem"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 4
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init –4"
            ^"Form" STRING "Mentem"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Allows a faerie to take complete control of a single human’s mind for a day, by making eye contact.

Costs 40 spell levels (ReMe as Enslave the Mortal Mind, ArM5 page 152)"
    }
    #tKoD0MQmyfe9BBfHSM8yd7fx ^"Fearful Flaming Eyes" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "2 points, Init –2, Corpus"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 2
            ^"Initiative" STRING "Init –2"
            ^"Form" STRING "Corpus"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Completely paralyzes a human who makes eye contact with the faerie.

Costs 15 spell levels (Base 5, +1 Eye, +1 Conc)"
    }
    #tQRAC6ULel4KmdJuDPfNhBdA ^"Grant Puissance in (Ability)" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tbQ683ClGPQQ2UpLbIXsx7h3 ^"Common Magic Power"
        PARAMETERS {
            ^"ability"
            OF ^"Ability"
        }
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Page" INTEGER 38
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "4 points, Init equal to (Qik – 3) Corpus R: Voice, D: Sun, T: Group Bestows prowess in a given activity. For every Might point invested, ten men can be given a +1 to all rolls in a general situation (such as combat, or woodcraft); or 1 man can be given a +3 to a specific Total or Ability (such as Soak or Hunt). Might points spent on this power are only recovered when its effects are withdrawn. MuCo 20 (base 2, +2 Voice, +2 Sun, +2 Group): Lesser Power (20 levels, +1 Init)"
        REFERENCES {
            "Lesser Power" -> #tJqI4D3GW3VqGLPkzIgItrUJ ^"Lesser Power"
        }
    }
    #tPy1S7sUkw192xgWIbWJGWla ^"Guide" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tbQ683ClGPQQ2UpLbIXsx7h3 ^"Common Magic Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Page" INTEGER 39
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "3 points, Init equal to (Qik +1), Mentem R: Voice, D: Conc, T: Group Subtly influences a group of beings toward a specific course of action. Some creatures can use this power to direct the movement of a group, taking it to a desired location. Other creatures can guide humans toward rash actions, or brave actions, or wise actions. Each time this power is used, it can subtly influence the actions of a single person for a day. The storyguide should provide advice to the character in a similar way to the Common Sense Virtue, except that the advice serves the creature’s agenda, not that of the character. There is no compulsion to follow this advice. ReMe 30 (base 5, +2 Voice, +1 Conc, +2 Group): Greater Power (30 levels, +4 Init)"
        REFERENCES {
            "Common Sense" -> #tSmfpmVQdvf6p6lQevHDQz9B ^"Common Sense"
            "Greater Power" -> #tI9yiBqA2pLll1mfoJpQrwzX ^"Greater Power"
        }
    }
    #tps2mhe92zCPwmhkQ5aR6ImR ^"Hands of the Animal" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Group" STRING "Greater and Lesser" FIXED
            ^"Might Cost" STRING "2 points, constant, appropriate Form"
            ^"Might Cost Value" INTEGER 2
            ^"Initiative" STRING "constant"
            ^"Form" STRING "appropriate Form"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Faerie"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "This allows an animal to manipulate and carry an item as if it had human hands and a Strength of +5. The character must concentrate to do anything other than carry the object, and to drop it or take something else.

Costs 15 spell levels (ReTe Base 3, +1 Touch, +2 Sun, +1 constant)"
    }
    #t8212cH2dmOVnFk7E6VuhNE2 ^"Hound" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t84d15c61569668f6f97c5a ^"Faerie Power"
        PROPERTIES {
