        }
        DESCRIPTION "1 point, Init (Qik – 2), Corpus R: Per, D: Sun, T: Ind The character feels as though he is unwounded and without fatigue until the sun rises or sets. (See Endurance of the Berserkers, ArM5 page 134.) ReCo 20 (base 10, +2 Sun): Personal Power (20 levels, –1 Might cost)"
        REFERENCES {
