        }
        DESCRIPTION "0 points (+10 Might), Init (Qik – 3), Ignem R: Touch, D: Mom, T: Ind The character sets fire to an individual target that is slightly inflammable, like damp wood, up to the size of a house. CrIg 25 (base 5, +1 Touch, +1 Mom, +2 size): Greater Power (25 levels, –3 Might cost, +2 Might)"
        REFERENCES {
            "Greater Power" -> #tI9yiBqA2pLll1mfoJpQrwzX ^"Greater Power"
