        DESCRIPTION "variable, Init (Qik – 5), Vim R: Voice, D: Mom, T: Ind As the spell on page 160 of Ars Magica Fifth Edition, the character can contribute 10 levels towards a spell cast with Communion by spending a Fatigue level. MuVi General (base effect, +2 Voice): Focus Power (10 levels, +5 Penetration) (Note that this is the version of the power to be taken as a Virtue; one taken as a Magic Quality would depend on the character’s Might.)"
        REFERENCES {
