            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "3 points, Init (Qik – 8), Corpus R: Touch, D: Mom, T: Ind The character permanently heals a single Light wound. CrCo 20 (Base 15, +1 Touch): Ritual Power (20 levels, –1 Might cost)"
        REFERENCES {
