            ^"Size" STRING "Major"
            ^"Category" STRING "Supernatural"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: The Infernal"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 83
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Some infernalists can teach corrupted knowledge, made possible by this Virtue. This gives the character the Supernatural Ability of Corruption at 1. See New Abilities, below, for details."
