            ^"Abilities" STRING "Arabic 5 (fast), (Area) Lore 2 (personalities), Artes Liberales 3 (Greek texts), Awareness 2 (details), Charm 2 (extracting information), Concentration 2 (long periods), Etiquette 2 (administrators), Folk Ken 2 (nobles), Greek 5 (translation), Guile 3 (quick lies), Intrigue 2 (gossip), Islamic Law 2 (Hadith), Profession (Scribe) 3 (speed), Stealth 2 (eavesdropping), Theology: Christianity 2 (saints), Theology: Islam 2 (history)"
