            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "Mendicant Friar; True Faith (Faith Score 5; Faith Points: 8); Animal Ken, Great Presence, Inspirational, Premonitions; Driven (Live like the apostles), Monastic Vows; Ability Block: logic, Compassionate, Fragile Constitution, Social Handicap (Unworldliness)"
