            "Corpus" "blood, breasts, fertility, the stomach"
            "Herbam" "fertility"
            "Mentem" "emotions, dreams, honesty, maternal urges"
            "Terram" "amber, silver"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The emotions of Apollo Eloure are deep and momentous, and are a guide towards true reconciliation with the world. As fire delighter, Apollo’s

rule over the fields and water is soft, honest, and loving."
    }
    #t4726b8e368b20a92abd89a ^"Iaó (Fire Feeler)" DEF {
        EXTENDS #t90c095c9b38d9aeacee505 ^"Beautiful Name of Light"
