            "Mentem" "imagination, the intellect, speech, spirits"
            "Terram" "opals"
            "Other" "the spirit world, obscurity, travel, secrecy"
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Apollo Óai is intelligent, quick thinking, and expressive. The light breather is adaptable and eloquent, ruling over animals, subtlety, and the imagination."
    }
    #td59ad5610d9a3744f28949 ^"Pentiterouni (Firewalker)" DEF {
