When this spell ends, the target recalls how to use the Form.

(Base 4, +1 Touch, +1 Diameter) Required Lab Total to invent spell: One Season (20), Two Seasons (15), Three Seasons (14), Four Seasons (13)."
    }
    #t1df24f47ac1e583357c819 ^"Touch of Falling Feathers" DEF {
