(Base 10, +1 Touch) Required Lab Total to invent spell: One Season (30), Two Seasons (23), Three Seasons (20), Four Seasons (19)."
    }
    #t83d6f07bad315700b2f1c0 ^"Lungs of Drowning" DEF {
