(Base 15, +1 Touch) Required Lab Total to invent spell: One Season (40), Two Seasons (30), Three Seasons (27), Four Seasons (25)."
    }
    #t20b878130862eeb90f76e7 ^"Paralysis of The Gift" DEF {
