            ^"Printed Entry" STRING "Columba, The Authority Granted to the Tribunal by its Members, Code of Hermes Tractatus, Quality 12, A deeply insightful polemic setting out the legal foundations on which magi may found their own Tribunal and the advantages of such a case. This book has no cost as its creation has been paid for by Columba’s starting experience points."
