            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 45
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Breaks the soil in a circle 15 paces across, making it ready for sowing or digging. (Base 2, +1 Touch, +1 Part, +3 levels for 6

times a day)"
    }
    #tdde8588f77bb6de7261fb4 ^"Beckoning in the Unwelcome Twilight" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tYiQyfVMioMALqPGoncvpTfY ^"Enchanted Device"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Part Of" STRING "Xenophanes’ Sickle"
            ^"Technique" STRING "Creo"
            ^"Form" STRING "Vim"
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Penetration" STRING "+20"
            ^"Uses" STRING "1/day"
            ^"Range" STRING "Touch"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Momentary"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Printed Effect Line" STRING "CrVi 25 Pen +20, 1/day R: Touch, D: Momentary, T: Individual"
            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 45
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Immediately grants two Warping Points to the person touched by the sickle, requiring a roll for Twilight in Hermetic magi. (Base 10, +1 Touch, +10 levels Penetration)"
    }
    #t4486f2284bfbd1a3433e29 ^"The Ever Changing Guise" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tYiQyfVMioMALqPGoncvpTfY ^"Enchanted Device"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Part Of" STRING "Beatriz’s Talisman"
            ^"Technique" STRING "Muto"
            ^"Form" STRING "Imaginem"
            ^"Level" INTEGER 14
            ^"Penetration" STRING "+0"
            ^"Uses" STRING "12/day"
            ^"Range" STRING "Personal"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Sun"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Printed Effect Line" STRING "MuIm 14 Pen +0, 12/day R: Personal, D: Sun, T: Individual"
            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 47
        }
        DESCRIPTION "As per the spell Disguise Of The New Visage

**ArM5**, page 146. Beatriz tends to change her physical appearance at whim, with often minor alterations in hairstyle or complexion throughout the day. Outside the covenant she never appears as Beatriz, always adopting a different appearance as a form of disguise. She almost never uses the effect at night, and does not use it when she is alone in her sanctum, so she is not constantly under the effect, and does not gain Warping from it. She does her best to use the effect whenever she is with other people, however. (Effect: Base 4, +2 Sun, 4 Levels 12 Uses a day)"
    }
    #tca7073af7c842682446535 ^"The Invisible Eye Revealed (Through the Aegis)" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tYiQyfVMioMALqPGoncvpTfY ^"Enchanted Device"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Printed Name" STRING "The Invisible Eye Revealed"
            ^"Part Of" STRING "Beatriz’s Talisman"
            ^"Technique" STRING "Intellego"
            ^"Form" STRING "Vim"
            ^"Level" INTEGER 25
            ^"Penetration" STRING "+0"
            ^"Uses" STRING "1/day"
            ^"Range" STRING "Personal"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Concentration"
            ^"Target" STRING "Touch"
            ^"Printed Effect Line" STRING "InVi 25 Pen +0, 1/day R: Personal, D: Concentration, T: Touch"
            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 47
        }
        DESCRIPTION "As per the spell of the same name in ArM5, page

157. Beatriz often feels others are hostile to her, and this effect reveals scrying magic up to level 50. She uses it infrequently, but sometimes when out and about the covenant, so if Jardin were being spied upon magically Beatriz would probably be the first to realize and notify the other magi. (Effect: Base 20, +1 Concentration)"
    }
    #t032d98473cbdb656d3544b ^"Whispers Through The Black Gate" DEF {
