**ArM5**, page 130. (Effect: Base 5, +1 Concentration, +1

Touch,)

The talisman also has the following attunements: +3 Corpus +4 affect breathing and speaking +4 affect Dead Wood

Beatriz is under the influence of a –5 longevity ritual."
    }
