            ^"Heart’s Desire" STRING "A True Friend, which he found in Hypatia."
            ^"Reputations" STRING "Weird Ascetic 2 (magi) Combat: Dodge: Init +0, Attack n/a, Defense +0, Damage n/a"
            ^"Soak" STRING "3"
            ^"Fatigue Levels" STRING "OK, 0, –1, –3, –5, Unconscious"
