            ^"Page" INTEGER 93
        }
        DESCRIPTION "These fist sized stones carved with images of rats prevent animals of less than Size

–1 from entering a Structure. The wards are used at the Miletos warehouses to prevent vermin from destroying stored goods. The Intellego requisite is required to exclude animals based on Size."
    }
    #t2aec2da7b0f034191f07f2 ^"Ward Against Rot" DEF {
