            ^"Range" STRING "Arcane"
            ^"Duration" STRING "Momentary"
            ^"Target" STRING "Individual"
            ^"Effect Design" STRING "(Base 2, +4 Arcane)"
            ^"Printed Effect Line" STRING "CrIg 10 Pen +0, 1/day R: Arcane, D: Momentary, T: Individual"
            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 93
        }
        DESCRIPTION "This wand ignites a brazier at the end of the Sacred Way (just outside the Aegis of the Hearth). The wand is carried by Callista and she lights the brazier to signal to the covenant that there is an emergency in Miletos.

When the brazier ignites, the covenfolk find a magus for assistance. Usually Ariane is the most useful as she can easily open an Intangible Tunnel to question Callista."
    }
    #t5dc23bed2eabc7c6e3ecfb ^"Bath Rock" DEF {
