            ^"Decrepitude" STRING "0 (3)"
            ^"Warping Score" STRING "1 (6)"
            ^"Confidence" STRING "1 (3)"
            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "Custos; Improved Characteristics, Intuition, Lightning Reflexes, Premonitions, Protection (Apollo Didyma), Second Sight, Tough; Greater Malediction (vis addicted), Envious; Fear (snakes), Oversensitive (accusations of free-loading), Visions due to Warping"
            ^"Personality Trait" STRING "Envious +6"
