            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 79
        }
        DESCRIPTION "The caster senses the distance and direction to the target. The caster must have an Arcane Connection to the target. Ariane casts this spell through an Intangible Tunnel.

(Base 3, +1 Touch, +1 Concentration)"
