            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 81
        }
        DESCRIPTION "Destroys the target’s scent. This is very useful for stalking animals (and other creatures) that rely on smell. Add +3 to Stealth rolls in such circumstances.

(Base 3, +1 Touch, +2 Sun)"
