            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "Outcast; Strong Goblin Blood; Affinity with Stealth, Improved Characteristics, Keen Vision, Learn Stealth from Mistakes, Puissant Stealth, Second Sight (from Strong Goblin Blood); Dark Secret (spy for a diabolist), Meddler (major); Judged Unfairly ) Goblin Blood gives a +1 modifier to stealth related rolls, but this is not included in Ability scores below."
