            ^"Spells" LIST [#t9ca04b7c7377b903da91fa ^"Piercing Lance of Bone", #tb498e032884c55fe4b7a27 ^"Stance of the Firm-Buttocked Knight", #t963b9f39c6c0976ecb8e64 ^"The Unerring Lance"]
