    # The book's two maps (the Normandy Tribunal, p15; Paris, p81), as ^"Figure" records. Their labels were read by
    # eye (no text layer); the transcription and how it was made: the-lion-and-the-lily/figures.json.
    # source: page 15, read by eye from the art (no text layer; figures.json)
    #tbc9f89c79f1405c0b6abb5 ^"The Normandy Tribunal, 1220 A.D. (map)" DEF {
        EXTENDS #tc349347caf3213a90237bd ^"Figure"
