        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Symbol" STRING "A spear formed from thigh bones and a skeletal hand"
            ^"Season" STRING "Winter"
            ^"Cathach" STRING "The Gáe Bulg; a spear made from the bones of the monster Coinchenn"
            ^"Location" LIST [#t76352f30e8d89186426ed3 ^"The Covenant of Praesis"]
            ^"Magi" LIST [#t55a7f0e66e42cd2ed7d7d5 ^"Ballack of Tytalus", #tc5200e7749cb0367ae4b67 ^"Báetáin Ua Traimair", #t7f1eb7a07bc1d1b10b0664 ^"Guillaume Flambeau of Normandy", #t70c52e191609578103fb2b ^"Cacht cultas Críamoine"]
            ^"Source" STRING "The Contested Isle"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 46
        }
    }
    # The Pact of Oireadh (Chapter Five: The Province of Connacht): the covenant, its printed particulars, its location, and references to its people and records.
