            ^"Magi" LIST [#t8a5854415b3730a94d30aa ^"Maria Laskarina of House Guernicus", #t512f2e87a5ac42e83f8c41 ^"Gerasimos the Simple of House Flambeau", #t0089f4b67f44fd9aa05f9a ^"Ioannes of House Bonisagus", #t28abb7d96bb6dc39e39d6d ^"Caterina da Vigonovo of House Jerbiton"]
